  "keyFeatures": [
    "Run Bukkit/Spigot plugins on Forge, NeoForge, and Fabric mod loaders",
    "Mixin-based patching system for deep Minecraft server integration",
    "Runtime class remapper for plugin compatibility with obfuscated mod environments",
    "Support for Minecraft 1.20 and 1.21",
    "Multi-platform support: Forge, NeoForge, and Fabric",
    "Bukkit registry bridge mapping mod entities/items to Bukkit API types",
    "Async task and event system compatible with both Bukkit and mod event buses",
    "Velocity/BungeeCord proxy support"
  ],
